WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.535 --> 00:00:04.136
-Here at "Late Night," every
night I deliver a monologue

00:00:04.136 --> 00:00:06.839
comprised of jokes written
by a diverse team of writers.

00:00:06.839 --> 00:00:09.842
As a result, a lot of jokes
come across my desk that,

00:00:09.842 --> 00:00:12.145
due to my being
a straight white male,

00:00:12.145 --> 00:00:14.581
would be difficult
for me to deliver.

00:00:14.581 --> 00:00:16.783
But we don't think that should
stop you from enjoying them,

00:00:16.783 --> 00:00:18.217
so we'd like to share them
with you now

00:00:18.217 --> 00:00:20.486
in a segment called
"Jokes Seth Can't Tell."

00:00:20.486 --> 00:00:22.522
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:24.324 --> 00:00:27.827
These are two of our writers,
Amber and Jenny.

00:00:27.827 --> 00:00:29.161
-I'm black.

00:00:29.161 --> 00:00:30.429
-And I'm gay.

00:00:30.429 --> 00:00:32.632
-And we're both women.

00:00:32.632 --> 00:00:34.400
-And I am not.

00:00:34.400 --> 00:00:35.668
So, here's how this works.

00:00:35.668 --> 00:00:37.570
I'll read the setups
for these jokes,

00:00:37.570 --> 00:00:39.539
and Amber and Jenny
will read the punch lines.

00:00:39.539 --> 00:00:41.140
Here we go!

00:00:41.140 --> 00:00:44.144
Today was National Be Late
for Something Day.

00:00:44.144 --> 00:00:46.613
-Yet another example
of white people

00:00:46.613 --> 00:00:48.715
appropriating black culture.

00:00:48.715 --> 00:00:50.249
[ Laughter ]

00:00:50.249 --> 00:00:52.485
[ Scattered applause ]

00:00:53.986 --> 00:00:57.123
-A lesbian horror film
recently premiered

00:00:57.123 --> 00:00:59.158
at the South by Southwest
festival.

00:00:59.158 --> 00:01:03.629
-It's called "Home Depot
Is Closing in Five Minutes."

00:01:03.629 --> 00:01:05.164
-Hey, Jenny,
what's your favorite thing

00:01:05.164 --> 00:01:06.232
to get at Home Depot?

00:01:06.232 --> 00:01:09.335
-A phone number.
-Okay.

00:01:09.335 --> 00:01:10.836
50 years ago, Charles Schulz,

00:01:10.836 --> 00:01:13.038
the creator of the comic strip
"Peanuts,"

00:01:13.038 --> 00:01:15.541
introduced his first
black character, Franklin.

00:01:15.541 --> 00:01:17.310
-It was the least he could do

00:01:17.310 --> 00:01:20.012
after letting Pigpen
walk around in blackface.

00:01:20.012 --> 00:01:23.382
[ Audience groans ]

00:01:23.382 --> 00:01:25.318
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:25.318 --> 00:01:29.788
-Oh! Oh, I'm glad I didn't try
to tell that one.

00:01:29.788 --> 00:01:32.959
-I regret having done so.

00:01:32.959 --> 00:01:35.895
-A gallery in New York
is currently showing an exhibit

00:01:35.895 --> 00:01:38.664
of photographs of lesbians
from the '60s and '70s.

00:01:38.664 --> 00:01:41.200
-Or as they were known
back then, roommates.

00:01:41.200 --> 00:01:43.335
-Oh, yeah.
[ Laughter ]

00:01:43.335 --> 00:01:44.636
And what are they known as now?

00:01:44.636 --> 00:01:46.338
-NCAA basketball coaches.

00:01:46.338 --> 00:01:48.141
-Oh, right, right, right.

00:01:48.141 --> 00:01:51.077
In response to Serena Williams'
protest against an umpire

00:01:51.077 --> 00:01:53.813
during the U.S. Open,
tennis star Martina Navratilova

00:01:53.813 --> 00:01:56.416
published an op-ed titled
"What Serena Got Wrong."

00:01:56.416 --> 00:01:58.217
-It's like
the old saying goes --

00:01:58.217 --> 00:02:00.319
Behind every successful
black person,

00:02:00.319 --> 00:02:02.755
there's a white person
who needs to shut up.

00:02:02.755 --> 00:02:04.423
[ Laughter ]

00:02:04.423 --> 00:02:06.493
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:08.361 --> 00:02:12.665
-Disney -- Disney is facing
backlash after it was announced

00:02:12.665 --> 00:02:15.334
that its first-ever
openly gay major character

00:02:15.334 --> 00:02:17.436
will be played
by a straight actor.

00:02:17.436 --> 00:02:21.374
-But in their defense, it's
really hard to find a gay actor.

00:02:21.374 --> 00:02:23.009
[ Laughter ]

00:02:23.009 --> 00:02:25.645
-Jenny, is it hard
to find gay actors?

00:02:25.645 --> 00:02:29.682
-No! 1/3 of the actors
at this desk are gay.

00:02:29.682 --> 00:02:31.083
At least.

00:02:31.083 --> 00:02:33.119
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:37.956 --> 00:02:40.793
-Two dozen white supremacists
held a rally recently

00:02:40.793 --> 00:02:42.161
outside the White House.

00:02:42.161 --> 00:02:43.262
-And when they were done,

00:02:43.262 --> 00:02:46.265
they went inside
and got back to work.

00:02:46.265 --> 00:02:47.833
-Amber!

00:02:47.833 --> 00:02:51.471
-It's funny because the
president's a white supremacist.

00:02:51.471 --> 00:02:53.105
[ Laughter ]

00:02:53.105 --> 00:02:54.974
-Oh, it is funny.

00:02:54.974 --> 00:02:56.542
-Those laws.

00:02:56.542 --> 00:02:59.579
-Alaska Airlines apologized
recently to a gay couple

00:02:59.579 --> 00:03:01.413
after asking one of them to move

00:03:01.413 --> 00:03:03.349
so a straight couple
could sit together.

00:03:03.349 --> 00:03:05.951
-Even worse, they asked
a lesbian couple,

00:03:05.951 --> 00:03:07.820
"How do you do it?"

00:03:07.820 --> 00:03:09.422
[ Laughter ]

00:03:09.422 --> 00:03:12.725
-Jenny, what's the question
people ask lesbians the most?

00:03:12.725 --> 00:03:15.828
-Can you open this jar for me?

00:03:15.828 --> 00:03:18.064
And P.S.,
the answer is always yes.

00:03:18.064 --> 00:03:19.532
-Okay.

00:03:19.532 --> 00:03:22.401
According to Politico,
white men are a minority

00:03:22.401 --> 00:03:25.004
among this year's
Democratic midterm candidates.

00:03:25.004 --> 00:03:28.608
-So from now on if you want to
see white men in the majority,

00:03:28.608 --> 00:03:31.711
you'll have to go to Harvard,
Yale, Princeton, Stansford,

00:03:31.711 --> 00:03:33.613
a Cubs game, a research lab.

00:03:33.613 --> 00:03:35.215
-A TED conference,
a NASCAR race,

00:03:35.215 --> 00:03:36.982
Wall Street, NASA,
the Supreme Court.

00:03:36.982 --> 00:03:39.619
-A math department, a movie
studio, an engineering firm.

00:03:39.619 --> 00:03:41.721
-Or a comedy writers' room.

00:03:41.721 --> 00:03:43.356
[ Laughter ]

00:03:43.356 --> 00:03:45.925
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:45.925 --> 00:03:47.260
-Stansford.

00:03:47.260 --> 00:03:48.995
[ Laughter ]

00:03:51.764 --> 00:03:53.466
A lot of people go to Stansford.

00:03:53.466 --> 00:03:57.437
-I didn't get into Stanford, but
I got wait-listed at Stansford.

00:03:57.437 --> 00:03:59.605
[ Laughter ]

00:03:59.605 --> 00:04:01.106
-A lot of people did.

00:04:01.106 --> 00:04:03.309
Hey, Seth,
why don't you tell one?

00:04:03.309 --> 00:04:04.877
-Oh, I couldn't!

00:04:04.877 --> 00:04:06.645
-Oh, come on.
Just one.

00:04:06.645 --> 00:04:08.714
-I feel like if I do,
I'm going to get in trouble.

00:04:08.714 --> 00:04:10.382
-No way, dude.
-Okay, okay.

00:04:10.382 --> 00:04:13.886
Then I'll do it with confidence.
-Okay.

00:04:13.886 --> 00:04:16.322
-The Denver Center
for the Performing Arts

00:04:16.322 --> 00:04:19.358
recently staged an all-black
performance of "Oklahoma!"

00:04:19.358 --> 00:04:21.827
Or as it's called,
"Oak-la-homey."

00:04:21.827 --> 00:04:23.929
-Seth, no!

00:04:23.929 --> 00:04:25.031
-What, what? Why?

00:04:25.031 --> 00:04:26.265
-Seth.
-No.

00:04:26.265 --> 00:04:27.900
-Well, I'll do another one
and win you back.

00:04:27.900 --> 00:04:29.301
-Okay.

00:04:29.301 --> 00:04:30.703
-The University of Oregon

00:04:30.703 --> 00:04:33.506
is currently organizing
a lesbian oral history project.

00:04:33.506 --> 00:04:34.941
-Don't do it.
-No, no, no, it's good.

00:04:34.941 --> 00:04:36.008
[ Laughter ]

00:04:36.008 --> 00:04:37.242
-Do not do this.

00:04:37.242 --> 00:04:38.477
-No, no, it's not going
where you think it is.

00:04:38.477 --> 00:04:40.879
Because if there's one thing
every lesbian has,

00:04:40.879 --> 00:04:42.715
it's an extensive oral history.

00:04:42.715 --> 00:04:44.250
-You did it.
-How dare you!

00:04:44.250 --> 00:04:46.452
-You told me it would be okay!

00:04:46.452 --> 00:04:48.721
-You should be ashamed
of yourself!

00:04:48.721 --> 00:04:51.257
-You said Stansford!
-I did.

00:04:51.257 --> 00:04:53.426
-Black women and lesbians
are liars!

00:04:53.426 --> 00:04:55.494
♪♪

00:04:55.494 --> 00:04:57.063
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:04:57.063 --> 00:05:00.033
We'll be right back with
Mariska Hargitay and Ice-T.

